# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# Personal QR codes point at sheffmsg.fun/<code>, which has no matching file.
# This serves the normal message page (index.html) for any such path WITHOUT a
# redirect (200 = rewrite), so the URL stays as /<code> and index.js can read the
# code. Real files and clean URLs (/spread, /messages, /styles.css, ...) are
# matched first and served normally.
/*    /index.html    200
